     comments: |
-      spi_cdns never set up the GPIOs listed in cs-gpios: it neither
-      initialised the context's CS list (SPI_CONTEXT_CS_GPIOS_INITIALIZE)
-      nor configured the pins (spi_context_cs_configure_all), which every
-      other GPIO-CS capable SPI driver does. The chip select stayed an
-      input, so a GPIO-selected device was never selected. Needed for the
-      SPI1 sensor benches on the TE0715 (CS on MIO13).
+      Backport of upstream commit 1b7a2b68e0e0 (PR #115179, merged
+      2026-08-10): spi_cdns used the devicetree register address as a
+      virtual address without mapping it. On the TE0715 (Cortex-A9, MMU on)
+      the first SPI_CONF write in spi_cdns_init() took a translation fault
+      at 0xe0007000 and Zephyr halted at boot. Drop when the fork moves past
+      it.
